[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Sabers/images/banner.jpg?v=2[/img]

Lightsabers for [b]Build 42[/b]. Hum, glow, and take zombies apart.

[table]
[tr][td][b]Game version[/b][/td][td]Build 42 only (42.0+)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Requires[/b][/td][td]Nothing[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Multiplayer[/b][/td][td]Yes. The server and every player need it[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Add mid-save[/b][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Mod ID[/b][/td][td]ZomboidSabers[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Sabers/images/h-get.png?v=2[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Sabers/images/get.png?v=2[/img]
[list]
[*][b]Scrap Saber:[/b] craft it from a flashlight, a metal pipe, duct tape, electronics scrap and a battery (Electricity 3, screwdriver).
[*][b]Chrome and Dark hilts:[/b] rare finds in pawn shops, army electronics stores, toy crates and video rental shelves.
[*][b]Kyber crystals:[/b] five colours, just as rare. Fit one to any hilt to change the blade colour.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Sabers/images/h-use.png?v=2[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Sabers/images/use.png?v=2[/img]
[list]
[*]Right-click the hilt to ignite it, or bind a key in Options > Mods.
[*]A lit saber hums, glows in its colour and lights up the floor around you.
[*]Huge damage, cuts through several zombies per swing and makes short work of doors.
[*]Runs on its power cell: about two in-game hours per full charge. Put in vanilla batteries to recharge it.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Sabers/images/h-cut.png?v=2[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Sabers/images/cut.png?v=2[/img]
Killing blows take heads off and sometimes cut zombies in half. Other hits take off arms and legs; a zombie that loses a leg crawls. Severed parts drop on the floor. All of it can be tuned or switched off in the sandbox options.

[h2]Sounds[/h2]
Every sound is original, synthesised for this mod. No film audio.

[h2]Sandbox[/h2]
Minutes lit per charge, charge per battery, dismemberment on or off, cut chances, dropped parts and loot rate.

